==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 31.67 seconds<sup>950f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Any crystals you collect will make this stage easier, albeit not required. The only real threat in this stage is St. Pigge the 2nd, but the low magnification essentially makes this stage free.

